<title>SWITZERLAND: U.S. suspends bid for WTO panel on EU grain row.</title>
<headline>U.S. suspends bid for WTO panel on EU grain row.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States on Tuesday withdraw a request for a World Trade Organisation dispute panel on European Union grain tariffs, trade officials said.</p>
<p>The WTO's Dispute Settlement Body (DSB) had been expected to agree to create the panel because it was the second time the U.S. had sought one.</p>
<p>But U.S. officials advised the DSB just before Tusday's meeting that it was not pursuing the request. There was no immediate explanation from the U.S. mission to the WTO,</p>
</text>
